            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A camera mount comprises a restricting portion (203) that restricts a restricted portion of a lens mount when the lens mount is mounted to the camera mount. The lens mount includes first and second claw portions adjacent to the restricted portion in a circumferential direction, and an opposite side claw portion disposed on an opposite side of the restricted portion with respect to the first and second claw portions in the circumferential direction. The camera mount further comprises third and fourth claw portions (208c, 208b) adjacent to the restricting portion (203) in the circumferential direction, and a fifth claw portion (208a) disposed on an opposite side of the restricting portion (203) with respect to the third and fourth claw portions (208c, 208d) in the circumferential direction. A dimension of the third claw portion (208c) in the circumferential direction is larger than dimensions of both the fourth claw portion (208b) and the fifth claw portion (208a) in the circumferential direction.</p>
            </abstract>
